[80,5,0,1850,"The Colossus of Abu Simbel","Du Camp photographed a gigantic statue of Pharaoh Ramses II at Abu Simbel and had a man stand by to show its scale. The statue is partly buried in sand, with a tiny figure at the right.","Find the person. How big is the statue compared to him?"],
